#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:119
msgid "Obter token CSRF"
msgstr "Get CSRF token"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:120
msgid ""
"Retorna o token CSRF necessário para requisições de escrita autenticadas por "
"cookie."
msgstr "Returns the CSRF token required for write requests authenticated by cookie."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:141
msgid "Registrar conta"
msgstr "Register account"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:142
msgid ""
"Cria uma nova conta de usuário e inicia a sessão com cookies de autenticação."
msgstr "Creates a new user account and starts the session with authentication cookies."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:152
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:99
msgid "Resolva o CAPTCHA para criar sua conta."
msgstr "Solve the CAPTCHA to create your account."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:182
msgid "Entrar"
msgstr "Credit"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:183
msgid ""
"Autentica com login e senha, podendo exigir CAPTCHA ou desafio de segundo "
"fator."
msgstr "Authenticates with login and password, and may require CAPTCHA or a second-factor challenge."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:192
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:100
msgid "Resolva o CAPTCHA para continuar."
msgstr "Solve the CAPTCHA to continue."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:221
msgid "Capacidades de autenticação"
msgstr "Authentication capabilities"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:222
msgid ""
"Informa flags de passkeys, 2FA, verificação de e-mail, CAPTCHA, provedores "
"OAuth e vínculos sociais da sessão."
msgstr "Reports the flags for passkeys, 2FA, email verification, CAPTCHA, OAuth providers and the social links of the session."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:247
msgid "Iniciar OAuth"
msgstr "Start OAuth"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:248
msgid ""
"Gera a URL de autorização do provedor social para login ou vínculo de conta."
msgstr "Generates the social provider authorization URL for login or account linking."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:281
msgid "Concluir OAuth"
msgstr "Complete OAuth"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:282
msgid ""
"Troca o código do provedor por sessão autenticada, vínculo de conta ou "
"desafio 2FA."
msgstr "Exchanges the provider code for an authenticated session, an account link or a 2FA challenge."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:325
msgid "Completar credenciais"
msgstr "Complete credentials"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:326
msgid ""
"Define username e senha para contas criadas via OAuth que ainda não possuem "
"credenciais locais."
msgstr "Sets the username and password for accounts created via OAuth that still have no local credentials."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:355
msgid "Renovar sessão"
msgstr "Refresh session"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:356
msgid "Rotaciona o refresh token e atualiza os cookies JWT da sessão."
msgstr "Rotates the refresh token and updates the session JWT cookies."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:361
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:101
msgid "Validação CSRF necessária."
msgstr "CSRF validation required."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:364
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:102 .\common\tests\test_i18n_gettext.py:96
msgid "Refresh token ausente."
msgstr "Refresh token missing."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:371
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:25
msgid "Refresh token inválido."
msgstr "Invalid refresh token."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:389
msgid "Sair"
msgstr "Sign out"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:390
msgid "Revoga o refresh token e remove os cookies de autenticação da resposta."
msgstr "Revokes the refresh token and removes the authentication cookies from the response."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:415
msgid "Listar sessões"
msgstr "List sessions"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:416
msgid ""
"Retorna as sessões de refresh ativas, marcando a sessão do navegador atual."
msgstr "Returns the active refresh sessions, flagging the current browser session."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:437
msgid "Revogar sessão"
msgstr "Revoke session"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:438
msgid ""
"Encerra uma sessão ativa pelo identificador ``jti``. A sessão atual também "
"limpa cookies."
msgstr "Ends an active session by its ``jti`` identifier. Ending the current session also clears cookies."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:462
msgid "Revogar outras sessões"
msgstr "Revoke other sessions"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:463
msgid ""
"Encerra todas as sessões ativas preservando apenas a sessão corrente do "
"navegador."
msgstr "Ends every active session, keeping only the current browser session."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:486
msgid "Obter perfil"
msgstr "Get profile"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:487
msgid "Retorna os dados do usuário autenticado na sessão atual."
msgstr "Returns the data of the user authenticated in the current session."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:497
msgid "Atualizar perfil"
msgstr "Updated at"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:498
msgid ""
"Atualiza campos do perfil do usuário autenticado e devolve o estado "
"atualizado."
msgstr "Updates profile fields of the authenticated user and returns the updated state."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:522
msgid "Verificar 2FA no login"
msgstr "Verify 2FA at login"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:523
msgid "Valida o código de segundo fator do desafio de login e inicia a sessão."
msgstr "Validates the second-factor code from the login challenge and starts the session."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:544
msgid "Gerenciar 2FA"
msgstr "Manage 2FA"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:545
msgid ""
"Configura, confirma ou desativa a autenticação de dois fatores da conta."
msgstr "Sets up, confirms or disables two-factor authentication for the account."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:562
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:117 .\common\tests\test_i18n_gettext.py:98
msgid "Ação 2FA inválida."
msgstr "Invalid 2FA action."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:577
msgid "Retorna progresso, recompensas e dados de jogo do usuário autenticado."
msgstr "Returns progress, rewards and game data of the authenticated user."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:594
msgid "Solicitar verificação de e-mail"
msgstr "Request email verification"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:595
msgid ""
"Dispara o envio do e-mail com o link de verificação da conta autenticada."
msgstr "Triggers the email carrying the verification link for the authenticated account."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:614
msgid "Verificar e-mail"
msgstr "Verify email"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:615
msgid ""
"Confirma o endereço de e-mail a partir do token recebido na mensagem de "
"verificação."
msgstr "Confirms the email address using the token received in the verification message."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:636
msgid "Solicitar redefinição de senha"
msgstr "Request password reset"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:637
msgid ""
"Envia o e-mail com o token para redefinir a senha da conta associada ao "
"endereço informado."
msgstr "Sends the email with the token to reset the password of the account linked to the given address."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:660
msgid "Confirmar redefinição de senha"
msgstr "Password confirmation"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:661
msgid "Define a nova senha usando o token de redefinição recebido por e-mail."
msgstr "Sets the new password using the reset token received by email."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:685
msgid "Resgatar recompensa"
msgstr "Reward"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\auth.py:686
msgid ""
"Resgata uma recompensa de progresso disponível para o usuário autenticado."
msgstr "Claims a progress reward available to the authenticated user."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:45
msgid "Listar passkeys"
msgstr "List passkeys"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:46
msgid "Retorna as credenciais passkey registradas pelo usuário autenticado."
msgstr "Returns the passkey credentials registered by the authenticated user."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:65
msgid "Iniciar registro de passkey"
msgstr "Start passkey registration"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:66
msgid ""
"Gera o desafio WebAuthn para criar uma nova credencial passkey na conta "
"autenticada."
msgstr "Generates the WebAuthn challenge to create a new passkey credential on the authenticated account."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:96
msgid "Concluir registro de passkey"
msgstr "Complete passkey registration"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:97
msgid ""
"Valida a resposta WebAuthn e persiste a nova credencial passkey do usuário."
msgstr "Validates the WebAuthn response and persists the user's new passkey credential."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:128
msgid "Iniciar login com passkey"
msgstr "Start passkey login"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:129
msgid ""
"Gera o desafio WebAuthn para autenticar o usuário com uma passkey existente."
msgstr "Generates the WebAuthn challenge to authenticate the user with an existing passkey."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:155
msgid "Concluir login com passkey"
msgstr "Complete passkey login"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:156
msgid ""
"Valida a asserção WebAuthn e inicia a sessão ou o desafio de segundo fator."
msgstr "Validates the WebAuthn assertion and starts the session or the second-factor challenge."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:170
#: .\common\i18n_msgid_catalog.py:103
msgid "Não foi possível autenticar com esta chave."
msgstr "Could not authenticate with this key."

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:199
msgid "Excluir passkey"
msgstr "Delete passkey"

#: .\apps\accounts\presentation\views\passkeys.py:200
msgid "Remove uma credencial passkey pertencente ao usuário autenticado."
msgstr "Removes a passkey credential belonging to the authenticated user."

