#: .\common\swagger.py:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"API REST do **PDL PRO** (Painel Definitivo Lineage 2.0).\n"
"\n"
"Backend somente API. O frontend React consome estes contratos.\n"
"\n"
"## Autenticação\n"
"\n"
"- **JWT** — cookie HttpOnly (`PDL-auth`) ou header `Authorization: Bearer "
"<token>`.\n"
"- Em escritas autenticadas por cookie, envie também `X-CSRFToken`.\n"
"\n"
"## Prefixos\n"
"\n"
"| Prefixo | Uso |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `/api/v1/auth/` | Cadastro, login, tokens, OAuth e passkeys |\n"
"| `/api/v1/shared/` | Perfil, carteira, loja, conteúdo autenticado |\n"
"| `/api/v1/public/` | Rankings, status do servidor, notícias e programas "
"públicos |\n"
"| `/api/v1/customer/` | Conta Lineage, inventário, jogos e apoiadores |\n"
"| `/api/v1/staff/` | Administração do painel |\n"
"| `/api/v1/system/` | Health e versão |\n"
"\n"
"## Contrato\n"
"\n"
"- Identificadores públicos são UUID (`id`). O `seq_id` sequencial é "
"interno.\n"
"- Erros 4xx/5xx usam o envelope `error_code`, `message`, `details` e "
"`request_id`.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"REST API for **PDL PRO** (Painel Definitivo Lineage 2.0).\n"
"\n"
"API-only backend. The React frontend consumes these contracts.\n"
"\n"
"## Authentication\n"
"\n"
"- **JWT** — HttpOnly cookie (`PDL-auth`) or `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.\n"
"- On writes authenticated by cookie, also send `X-CSRFToken`.\n"
"\n"
"## Prefixes\n"
"\n"
"| Prefix | Usage |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `/api/v1/auth/` | Sign-up, login, tokens, OAuth and passkeys |\n"
"| `/api/v1/shared/` | Profile, wallet, shop, authenticated content |\n"
"| `/api/v1/public/` | Rankings, server status, news and public programs |\n"
"| `/api/v1/customer/` | Lineage account, inventory, games and supporters |\n"
"| `/api/v1/staff/` | Panel administration |\n"
"| `/api/v1/system/` | Health and version |\n"
"\n"
"## Contract\n"
"\n"
"- Public identifiers are UUID (`id`). The sequential `seq_id` is internal.\n"
"- 4xx/5xx errors use the `error_code`, `message`, `details` and `request_id` envelope.\n"

